{"4682430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Robosynthesis", "steam_appid": 4682430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robosynthesis</strong> is a 3D Action / Puzzle Platformer, where you control SUNNI – the robot who’s just been re-activated after a new ray of sun cracked through their underground facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682430/extras/1f187624d9fb995d3c01ebf4126afc7f.poster.avif?t=1779990565\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682430/extras/1f187624d9fb995d3c01ebf4126afc7f.webm?t=1779990565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682430/extras/1f187624d9fb995d3c01ebf4126afc7f.mp4?t=1779990565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twist? Your movement, health, and ammo all use precious solar energy. Plan your actions carefully to seek freedom, as every step may be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new discovery lurks behind every corner. Will SUNNI escape the facility... and uncover what happened long ago?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 20 to 40 minutes of playtime for a first playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 large main levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 secret data logs to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Museum with 40+ pieces of concept art, design sketches, and early game screenshots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bonus levels referencing other Cocoteam games..?!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional retro pixelation filter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUR STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robosynthesis was developed with a core team of five students for Senior Project @ Eastern Michigan University. The game was created from scratch within one semester.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robosynthesis</strong> is a 3D Action / Puzzle Platformer, where you control SUNNI – the robot who’s just been re-activated after a new ray of sun cracked through their underground facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682430/extras/1f187624d9fb995d3c01ebf4126afc7f.poster.avif?t=1779990565\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682430/extras/1f187624d9fb995d3c01ebf4126afc7f.webm?t=1779990565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682430/extras/1f187624d9fb995d3c01ebf4126afc7f.mp4?t=1779990565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twist? Your movement, health, and ammo all use precious solar energy. Plan your actions carefully to seek freedom, as every step may be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new discovery lurks behind every corner. Will SUNNI escape the facility... and uncover what happened long ago?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 20 to 40 minutes of playtime for a first playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 large main levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 secret data logs to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Museum with 40+ pieces of concept art, design sketches, and early game screenshots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bonus levels referencing other Cocoteam games..?!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional retro pixelation filter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUR STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robosynthesis was developed with a core team of five students for Senior Project @ Eastern Michigan University. The game was created from scratch within one semester.</p>", "short_description": "A solar-powered robot awakens in an abandoned data center. — In this short 3D platformer, your movement, health, and ammo all use precious solar energy. Plan your actions carefully to seek freedom, as every step may be your last.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682430/9aee5edb72bcb9e06beb33f21c855d8d26096842/header.jpg?t=1779990565", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682430/679af1ba791d15bcb8ef321975aa54e379484ce7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779990565", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682430/679af1ba791d15bcb8ef321975aa54e379484ce7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779990565", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Anything made within the past 5-10 years<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 6 GB VRAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</st